From: MCC45TR <75160848+MCC45TR@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] soc: qcom: llcc: check for the optional broadcast-AND window

The optional sixth window is absent on Cliffs7. Check its resource before
mapping it; retain mapping errors and the existing legacy EINVAL fallback.
No LLCC windows, bank count, cache policy or activation values change.

--- a/drivers/soc/qcom/llcc-qcom.c
+++ b/drivers/soc/qcom/llcc-qcom.c
@@ -5782,8 +5782,9 @@ static int qcom_llcc_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)
 		goto err;
 	}
 
 	/* Applicable only when drv_data->version >= 4.1 */
-	if (drv_data->version >= LLCC_VERSION_4_1_0_0) {
+	if (drv_data->version >= LLCC_VERSION_4_1_0_0 &&
+	    platform_get_resource(pdev, IORESOURCE_MEM, i + 1)) {
 		drv_data->bcast_and_regmap = qcom_llcc_init_mmio(pdev, i + 1, "llcc_broadcast_and_base");
 		if (IS_ERR(drv_data->bcast_and_regmap)) {
 			ret = PTR_ERR(drv_data->bcast_and_regmap);
